	quests: [
		{
			title: "Oxygen Not Included"
			x: -5.5d
			y: 0.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5The next two worlds are... well, they are quite doozies. And probably the most opposite places you could find from each other."
				""
				"&dOne is a world that is nothing but deep, deep water. The other isn't a world but...an asteroid belt digitized INTO a world."
				""
				"&5Both means you'll need to bring your own oxygen, just like Vox Ponds."
				""
				"&dUnless you can breath without air. You might be able to with specific Origins? I'm not sure."
			]
			dependencies: ["256E65F067E661D0"]
			id: "172942303A0E2928"
			tasks: [{
				id: "62353DE0DAB795C7"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Deep in the Sea"
			x: -3.5d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&5L'Borean worlds are water worlds, more or less. "
				""
				"&dAnd we don't mean like that movie. The ENTIRE world is covered in water, and there is nothing on the surface."
				""
				"&5These kind of worlds have very unique creatures and resources, part of why its so deep in the FOP Game Server."
				""
				"&dIf you want to get to L'Borean, you'll need to grab a bucket of Candied Water from Candyland, and bring it to Gardencia."
				""
				"&5And a Blank Realmstone of course. Get a Gardencia creature to walk into the Candied Water, then kill it to get the L'Borean Realmstone."
				""
				"&dCandied Water to Gardencia creatures is like Spinach to Popeye. So be careful!"
			]
			dependencies: ["172942303A0E2928"]
			id: "6E45D8573D19638D"
			tasks: [{
