		{
			title: "Under Da Sea"
			x: -0.75d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Well, it's time to swim I guess, Bandit."
				""
				"&dThis place is kind of pretty. Lots of coral. Lots of sea life. "
				""
				"&5And lots of things trying to murder you, since they can now just swim up and down towards you. On your guard, Bandit."
				""
				"&dHm, may be time to invest in actual diving equipment, Bandit. Do the FOP sell a submarine by chance? Can WE get a submarine in for Bandit?"
				""
				"&5Probably not.."
			]
