		{
			title: "Master and Monster"
			x: 4.75d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5L'Borean has two bosses, but they are very very... different."
				""
				"&dSee, one of them was put here by the FOP, a flying dragon by the name of Dracyon. Dracyon is one of the first of the Board of Directors you will have to face, Bandit."
				""
				"&5A very tough one, he got into the position with smart tactics and ruthlesness."
				""
				"&dThe other boss is one who was on L'Borean when it was digitized : a creature called Corallus. She was originally a mermaid, and protected these waters... which Dracyon took advantage of. He mutated her, twisted her into a dangerous monster."
				""
				"&5He doesn't have control of her, however. He didn't plan for that, but it works out for him, because she is quite dangerous. He enabled her to get a boss card, to help protect L'Borean from Power Users."
			]
			dependencies: ["73C578E0D6447D7A"]
			id: "6F4BC7533A3F122E"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4AC6F3C4C2A7A85D"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Twisted Protector"
			x: 7.0d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Corallus is quite a dangerous creature to fight, Bandit. We aren't sure if she is still sentient or not, given how badly twisted Dracyon has made her."
				""
				"&dWe can try, that's for sure. While my brother and I look into how to stop Corallus, Bandit, you need to get a way to call her attention at least."
				""
				"&dThe Amphibiytes are a favorite of hers, getting one of their lungs should be enough."
			]
			dependencies: ["6F4BC7533A3F122E"]
			id: "285E2046D6E7C043"
			tasks: [{
				id: "52DEBAD7657660B8"
