			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS BRIBE"
			description: [
				"&5I think a good way for us to get past Corallus is to reverse at least some of what Dracyon has done to her. Curing some of her mutation, or at least the rage and madness that came with it."
				""
				"&dWhich is no short order, Bandit. You'll need to dive into a bunch of different magic and tech schools to get the right components."
				""
				"&5You'll also have to pray to lady luck. Bezoars only spawn as dungeon loot, the FOP doesn't sell them in any of their merchant shops or in their \"additional\" resource purchases."
