		{
			title: "Dragon Flight"
			x: 8.5d
			y: -0.75d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&5Now that you have a Call of the Drake, you'll need to find a Drake Fountain. These appear on the ocean floor, and have a Dracyon Altar on them. Use the Call of the Drake on the Dracyon Altar to summon Dracyon for an audience."
				""
				"&dDracyon will fly and swim around, attacking you. If you somehow manage to summon him on land, he'll occasionally create water in spots to slow you down."
				""
				"&5As we said, he's smart. He's also very deadly, if his attacks hit you'll get a slash across your HUD to mess with your view. He'll also launch slowing shots at you."
				""
				"&dManage to take him down, and he has a chance of dropping a special weapon or armor."
			]
			dependencies: ["678586175505BC35"]
