		{
			title: "Deep in Space"
			x: -3.5d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&5Lunalus is the world slot reserved for the sections of Asteroid Belts that the FOP have decided to digitize. Usually because they are actually home to various species the FOP wants to capitalize on. Or rare ore asteroids."
				""
				"&dUsually both if they can swing it. It also makes a good way to discourage Power Users from reaching the Board of Directors."
				""
				"&5So you'll want to make sure you have a way to fly, swing, teleport, what have you around. "
				""
				"&dTo get the Lunalus Realmstone, buy a Gravitator from a Toy Merchant in Celeve, and bring it to Haven. You'll need to jump from a high spot,a nd float ACROSS the void between islands with the Gravitator."
				""
				"&5If you land safely, the Blank Realmstone will convert."
			]
			dependencies: ["172942303A0E2928"]
			id: "343CA0931F27556D"
			tasks: [{
				id: "305536B4F6B839FD"
				type: "item"
