		{
			title: "Orb"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5While exploring around Lunalus, be careful. Not only are the various creatures trapped in the Asteroid Belt possibly dangerous, the boss of Lunalus also wanders around, keeping a careful eye on things."
				""
				"&dShouldn't be too hard to avoid getting their attention. As you explore and scuffle with the others trapped here, keep an eye out for these Orbulons."
				""
				"&5These are apparently what the FOP digitized this entire section of Asteroid Belt for. Most of it has been collected by all the trapped creatures, however. "
				""
				"&dThat means it must be pretty interesting stuff. There's also some stuff called Lunar metal? Thats probably another thing they wanted... Guess it's time to see what they can make!"
