		{
			title: "All Seeing"
			x: 4.75d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5You've probably already seen his health bar on your HUD, Bandit. Visualent, the Boss of Lunalus. Also one of the first of the Board of Directors"
				""
				"&dHe got the position from being extremely watchful on all his subordinates. So much so that he became Visualant, a monsterous eye creature that roams the asteroids of Lunalus."
				""
				"&5If he hasn't appeared to oversee his world, you can get his attention with an Observant Eye. Zal Ships can have them in the cargo hold."
			]
			dependencies: ["39BE15A0915D0CDF"]
