		}
		{
			title: "No Reasoning"
			x: 7.0d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Given this is one of the Board of Directors, there is no reasoning with him, Bandit."
				""
				"&dThey didn't get on the board for the FOP for altruistic reasons. "
				""
				"&5So unfortunately, there's only one course of action for the Board of Directors : defeating them."
				""
				"&dWe can look into it, but absolutely no promises. It'd definitely help lessen the amount of fighting these final worlds will require."
				""
				"&5If Visualent hasn't appeared to spy on his asteroids, you can take an Observant Eye from a Zal Ship and toss it onto the ground of any asteroid."
			]
			dependencies: ["6C84C4F697C4D44A"]
