			description: [
				"&5While there is one more dimension in this Tier of the FOP Game Server, it's been sectioned off into its own DLC Tier : Indigo. You'll need to obtain the Indigo Dimension DLC before you can go to Runandor."
				""
				"&dThough you might have seen portals to Runandor in Mysterium, you may have gotten stuck trying to go through them. It's a weird joke they have...or weird type of encouragement for you to purchase more DLC before you are ready."
				""
				"&5Either way, I'd aim for getting the last two Dimension DLC unlocks before long. You have two worlds to go, and each one is on its own Tier now."
				""
